# Stranglethorn Vale - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes, patterns and plans whose SOURCE is physically in
# Stranglethorn Vale (Booty Bay sits on this map and counts as zone
# content), verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever
# item vendor and drop tables). Thirty-six recipes are vendor-sold by
# in-zone Alliance-safe vendors (Kelsey Yance, Glyx Brewright, Xizk
# Goodstitch, Cowardly Crosby, Narkk, Corporal Bluth, Rikqiz, Rin'wosho
# the Trader, Pix Xizzix, Blixrez Goodstitch); three more drop each from
# a single named in-zone mob. The two same-title Enchanter's Cowl
# patterns are both sold by Xizk Goodstitch and both ship with a note.
# The Omelet and Spiced Chili Crab are excluded - their only in-zone
# vendors are Horde-faction (Alterac precedent). Everything else
# Stranglethorn-dropping is a generic multi-zone world drop (Elwynn rule),
# the world-boss patterns are out of reach for a 30-45 guide (Feralas
# precedent), and quest records carry no reward data, so none of those
# ships (see docs/stranglethorn-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to
# its profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Blacksmithing,
# Engineering, First Aid and Fishing have no Stranglethorn source, so
# that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/stranglethorn-recipes
title Stranglethorn Vale - Recipes & Patterns
levels 30-45
zone Stranglethorn Vale
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords stranglethorn, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Booty Bay vendors - Kelsey's stock (Cooking)

  zone map 1434

  when skill Cooking 1

  tip Kelsey Yance (28.23, 74.34) sells recipes in Booty Bay.
  buy 6039 "Recipe: Giant Clam Scorcho"
  buy 6369 "Recipe: Rockscale Cod"
  buy 13940 "Recipe: Cooked Glossy Mightfish"
  buy 13941 "Recipe: Filet of Redgill"
  buy 13943 "Recipe: Hot Smoked Bass"
  buy 17062 "Recipe: Mithril Head Trout"
  buy 21099 "Recipe: Smoked Sagefish"
  buy 21219 "Recipe: Sagefish Delight"

