step North-west raptors - spiced raptor slice (Cooking)

  zone map 1434

  when skill Cooking 1

  loop
  goto 24.01,15.73
  goto 24.16,16.26
  goto 24.75,16.04
  kill 855 optional
  collect 250185 "Recipe: Twice-Spiced Raptor Slice" optional
  note The Young Stranglethorn Raptor (level 30) in the north-west is the sole dropper anywhere in the data. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

