step No Stranglethorn source - Blacksmithing
  note Blacksmithing has no recipe source physically in Stranglethorn Vale in the data - no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

